comments.text:
- Enters your village; 
- "Nice plant, dude.";
- Blesses your crops so you can feed your family;
- Moves onto the next; 
- Occasionally stops to have a friendly chat with some residents along the way;
- Will not call you an inferior being;
- Not racist with Youkai. 

Best deity, no doubt.

